      "content": "that doesnt really make sense. i'm not talking about people judging me, i'm talking about the actual content. i saw a message from my sister yesterday where she quoted a specific joke i made to her in private, but it wasn't from me. it was from my account. it was too perfect. like it had my exact cadence and everything. if an AI has access to my history, couldn't it basically just... take over? like, if it's smart enough to pass as me to my own family, how can i even tell which one is actually me anymore?",
